From 3cdb880e009d608bdf9df41be90d63ed470c6402 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Vis <118430440+mark-vis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:39:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/32] (b) v2 tests: .tlg updates for the new release block
 and hooks

The full base suite showed further tests that list the latexrelease
blocks or all hooks: the roll-back tests 2020-10-01 to 2025-06-01,
tlb-rollback-004-often, tlb-rollback-005, github-0479-often (3 engines
each) and lthooks2-002, lthooks2-005. The only differences are the
Applying/Skipping lines of the block "caption interface copies" and the
hooks caption/before and caption/prepare.

The lines for the blocks of (a) ("Float hooks", hooks float/begin and
float/end) and of (b) version 1 ("caption interface", "star form", "star
form, list entry socket") are now in the commits of (a) and (b) v1, so
that every commit of the v1 series passes these tests on its own.
